  "details": "Was making a script that forces the player to stay seated when they respawn, when I found the bug. The fix was to just delay it by a frame, but it was funny XD\n\nHere's the simplified code:\n\npublic class ChairGlitchTest : UdonSharpBehaviour\n\n{\n\n    public override void Interact()\n\n    {\n\n        Networking.LocalPlayer.UseAttachedStation();\n\n    }\n\n    public override void OnStationExited(VRCPlayerApi player)\n\n    {\n\n        player.UseAttachedStation();\n\n    }\n\n}",
